# .ctxignore
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Same syntax as .gitignore. Copy this file to ".ctxignore" in your
# project root and customize it. Patterns here are ADDED on top of
# ctx-gen's built-in defaults (node_modules, .git, dist, venv, etc.)
# — you don't need to re-list those.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------

# Folders
fixtures/
scripts/one-off/

# Specific files
CHANGELOG.md
*.snap

# Test data / fixtures that add noise, not signal
**/__mocks__/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
